<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Admin Login Alert</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #fffbe6;
      padding: 20px;
    "
  >
    <div style="background-color: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px">
      <h2 style="color: #b50000">🛡️ Admin Login Notification</h2>
      <p>Hello Admin <strong><%= firstName %></strong>,</p>
      <p>
        This is to notify you that your admin account was just accessed on
        <strong>Smart Pro</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>If this wasn't you, please reset your password immediately.</p>
      <p>Stay secure 🔐</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
